WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:17.715
The king was bored.

2
00:00:17.716 --> 00:00:27.293
"Read a book," the queen said.

3
00:00:27.294 --> 00:00:30.562
"It's raining," the king said.

4
00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:33.165
"Rain makes me grumpy."

5
00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:36.355
"Dirk," said the queen.

6
00:00:36.356 --> 00:00:38.561
"Fetch the new jester.

7
00:00:38.562 --> 00:00:41.167
He'll make the king laugh."

8
00:00:41.168 --> 00:00:49.393
Dirk gulped.

9
00:00:49.394 --> 00:00:55.609
Then he hurried out.

10
00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:58.440
"Uh-oh," thought Tom.

11
00:00:58.441 --> 00:01:03.213
"I think Dirk forgot to hire a new jester."

12
00:01:03.214 --> 00:01:05.384
Dirk came back.

13
00:01:05.385 --> 00:01:09.310
He was dragging a strange boy.

14
00:01:09.311 --> 00:01:12.777
"Here's the new jester!" Dirk said.

15
00:01:12.778 --> 00:01:15.892
The boy looked surprised.

16
00:01:15.893 --> 00:01:19.253
"Make me laugh," said the king.

17
00:01:19.254 --> 00:01:24.493
"Um . . ." The boy looked nervous.

18
00:01:24.494 --> 00:01:27.570
"I can fix things," he said.

19
00:01:27.571 --> 00:01:30.101
"Do you have a hole in your bucket?"

20
00:01:30.102 --> 00:01:35.437
"Ha-ha!" Dirk laughed loudly.

21
00:01:35.438 --> 00:01:43.085
"That's funny!"

22
00:01:43.086 --> 00:01:45.782
But the king frowned.

23
00:01:45.783 --> 00:01:48.713
"Juggle something," the king said.

24
00:01:48.714 --> 00:02:00.691
Dirk got some plates.

25
00:02:00.692 --> 00:02:03.698
The jester threw the plates into the air.

26
00:02:03.699 --> 00:02:05.667
He tried to catch them.

27
00:02:05.668 --> 00:02:10.855
The plates crashed to the floor.

28
00:02:10.856 --> 00:02:15.655
The king and Dirk laughed.

29
00:02:15.656 --> 00:02:18.278
But the queen was angry.

30
00:02:18.279 --> 00:02:22.464
"You broke my best dishes!" she said.

31
00:02:22.465 --> 00:02:26.255
Everybody stopped laughing.

32
00:02:26.256 --> 00:02:30.787
"Tomorrow is the Grand Banquet," the king said.

33
00:02:30.788 --> 00:02:34.939
"Jester, you must make everyone laugh!"

34
00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:39.349
"But no broken dishes!" the queen said.

35
00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:43.893
"I will lock the jester in his room," Dirk said.

36
00:02:43.894 --> 00:02:46.682
"He can practice all night."

37
00:02:46.683 --> 00:02:48.460
The boy spoke.

38
00:02:48.461 --> 00:02:49.939
"But I'm not a—"

39
00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:58.566
"Come with me!" Dirk snapped.

